			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-995088">
									

<p>I like this one, but I don't like the vengeful aspect with the high pressure champagne bottles. That just crosses the fine line between creepy and silly. Does <em>everything</em> have to fight back? Sure, some chucklehead in this comments section is going to demand test logs full of "But what if we did THIS or launched it into the sun or threw a party for 682 with it?" but <em>who cares.</em></p>
<p>In fact, I'd be happier if there wasn't even the "join us and vanish into the box" aspect. It would be better in my opinion if this was just a totally fun, seemingly harmless beer commercial in a box but every now and then the random partygoers break down and beg for release.</p>

